 1.5px; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 16px;\">🔄 Ohm's Law — All Forms</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 12px;\">\n    <div style=\"background: #eff6ff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Find Voltage</div>\n\n$$V = I \\times R$$\n\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background: #f0fdf4; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #22c55e; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Find Current</div>\n\n$$I = \\dfrac{V}{R}$$\n\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background: #fff1f2; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #fecdd3;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #f43f5e; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Find Resistance</div>\n\n$$R = \\dfrac{V}{I}$$\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Key Takeaway -->\n<div style=\"background: #fefce8; border: 1px solid #fde68a; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 24px; display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size: 22px;\">💡</div>\n  <div>\n    <div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #92400e; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Key Insight</div>\n    <div style=\"color: #78350f; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">Doubling the current <strong>doubles</strong> the voltage. Doubling the resistance also <strong>doubles</strong> the voltage. They are directly proportional — a core principle in circuit design.</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</div>",
